{"id":"39106533930cb3c4","group":"58","path":"58/batch15/58-df-zfc-comb-splitting-family.md","title":"ZFC Comb Splitting Family","display":"df-zfc-comb-splitting-family — ZFC Comb Splitting Family","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-comb-splitting-family","aliases":["58-df-zfc-comb-splitting-family","58-df-zfc-comb8-splitting-family","58-df-zfc-comb7-splitting-family","58-df-zfc-comb7-reaping-family"],"display":"df-zfc-comb-splitting-family — ZFC Comb Splitting Family","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-family]]","[[58-df-gaps]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-comb-splitting-family"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-comb-splitting-family</span><span>58-df-zfc-comb8-splitting-family</span><span>58-df-zfc-comb7-splitting-family</span><span>58-df-zfc-comb7-reaping-family</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-comb-splitting-family — ZFC Comb Splitting Family"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"545b51e7aa011030\" href=\"?note=545b51e7aa011030\" title=\"58-df-family\">58-df-family</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5c1f6f430663d687\" href=\"?note=5c1f6f430663d687\" title=\"58-df-gaps\">58-df-gaps</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal S\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\omega)\">\\(\\mathcal S\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\omega)\\)</span> (family of subsets of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"545b51e7aa011030\" href=\"?note=545b51e7aa011030\" title=\"58-df-family\">58-df-family</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in[\\omega]^\\omega\">\\(A\\in[\\omega]^\\omega\\)</span> (infinite subset)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\subseteq^*\">\\(\\subseteq^*\\)</span> (almost-inclusion relation)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcCombSplittingFamily}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcCombSplittingFamily}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcComb8SplittingFamily}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcComb8SplittingFamily}_S\\)</span> (alias predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcComb7SplittingFamily}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcComb7SplittingFamily}_S\\)</span> (alias predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcComb7ReapingFamily}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcComb7ReapingFamily}_S\\)</span> (reaping-family predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comb\\text{-}splitting\\text{-}family} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcCombSplittingFamily}_S(\\mathcal S)\\leftrightarrow \\mathcal S\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\omega)\\land \\forall A\\in[\\omega]^\\omega\\;\\exists S\\in\\mathcal S\\;(|A\\cap S|=\\omega\\land |A\\setminus S|=\\omega)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comb\\text{-}splitting\\text{-}family} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcCombSplittingFamily}_S(\\mathcal S)\\leftrightarrow \\mathcal S\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\omega)\\land \\forall A\\in[\\omega]^\\omega\\;\\exists S\\in\\mathcal S\\;(|A\\cap S|=\\omega\\land |A\\setminus S|=\\omega)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comb8\\text{-}splitting\\text{-}family\\text{-}alias} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcComb8SplittingFamily}_S(\\mathcal S)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcCombSplittingFamily}_S(\\mathcal S)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comb8\\text{-}splitting\\text{-}family\\text{-}alias} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcComb8SplittingFamily}_S(\\mathcal S)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcCombSplittingFamily}_S(\\mathcal S)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comb7\\text{-}splitting\\text{-}family\\text{-}alias} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcComb7SplittingFamily}_S(\\mathcal S)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcCombSplittingFamily}_S(\\mathcal S)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comb7\\text{-}splitting\\text{-}family\\text{-}alias} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcComb7SplittingFamily}_S(\\mathcal S)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcCombSplittingFamily}_S(\\mathcal S)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comb7\\text{-}reaping\\text{-}family} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcComb7ReapingFamily}_S(\\mathcal S)\\leftrightarrow \\mathcal S\\subseteq[\\omega]^\\omega\\land\\forall X\\in[\\omega]^\\omega\\;\\exists R\\in\\mathcal S\\;(R\\subseteq^*X\\lor R\\subseteq^*(\\omega\\setminus X))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comb7\\text{-}reaping\\text{-}family} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcComb7ReapingFamily}_S(\\mathcal S)\\leftrightarrow \\mathcal S\\subseteq[\\omega]^\\omega\\land\\forall X\\in[\\omega]^\\omega\\;\\exists R\\in\\mathcal S\\;(R\\subseteq^*X\\lor R\\subseteq^*(\\omega\\setminus X))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Auxiliary ZFC definition.</li>\n<li><code>58-df-zfc-comb8-splitting-family</code> is merged here; it used the same splitting condition.</li>\n<li>The reaping-family predicate is distinct from the splitting-family predicates: one member of a reaping family is almost contained in either side of every infinite split.</li>\n<li>Mod-finite inclusion comes from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5c1f6f430663d687\" href=\"?note=5c1f6f430663d687\" title=\"58-df-gaps\">58-df-gaps</a>; the former stationary-set splitting dependency did not define this symbol. Every assertion now has a unique label.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-family","status":"resolved","id":"545b51e7aa011030","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-family]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-gaps","status":"resolved","id":"5c1f6f430663d687","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-gaps]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-family","status":"resolved","id":"545b51e7aa011030","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal S\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\omega)$ (family of subsets of $\\omega$, see [[58-df-family]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-gaps","status":"resolved","id":"5c1f6f430663d687","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"Mod-finite inclusion comes from [[58-df-gaps]]; the former stationary-set splitting dependency did not define this symbol. Every assertion now has a unique l